[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3189.67, "timestamp": "00:53:09", "text": "。嗯，所以，回到這個問題，我的反應會是什麼？我的意思是，我並不介意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3202.95, "timestamp": "00:53:22", "text": "我的意思是，我想讓我的藝術家媽媽知道，如果我正在和一位藝術家合作，我知道他們非常努力，而且他們也很擅長自己的工作，我希望他們能抓住更多機會，與其他創作者合作，獲得更大的項目和新的體驗等等，即使創作者之間存在一些矛盾，比如這位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3208.79, "timestamp": "00:53:28", "text": "藝術家曾經"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3211.51, "timestamp": "00:53:31", "text": "合作過的那些。我會盡量私下解決這件事，達成和平協議，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3214.069, "timestamp": "00:53:34", "text": "而不是像高中生那樣處理，要嘛無視對方，要嘛乾脆搬走。但是，我意識到，有時時間能治癒一切，說實話，隨著時間的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3222.786, "timestamp": "00:53:42", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yes"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3228.096, "timestamp": "00:53:48", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and its slowly killing me"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3232.27, "timestamp": "00:53:52", "text": "推移，事情會好轉。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3237.605, "timestamp": "00:53:57", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "tung tung tung tung sahur"}]